# GET_STATUS answered after two WAIT_STATE bytes.
#
# HAND BUILT FROM THE SPECIFICATION, NOT FROM THE CAPTURE. Read this before
# trusting it: espi_dump.txt contains no wait states and no GET_STATUS at all,
# so unlike the three fixtures beside it, nothing independent confirms these
# bytes ever appeared on a real bus. It is the weakest evidence in the suite.
#
# What it does pin is the CRC exclusion, and it pins it sharply. WAIT_STATE is
# 0Fh (Table 3, p.30) and is excluded from the CRC calculation (section 3.10,
# p.45). The trailing 95h is the CRC over 08 0F 01 only. If a decoder folded
# either wait state into the CRC it would compute something else and this
# fixture would fail -- which is the entire reason it exists.
#
# CRC bytes are pasted from tools/crc_ref.py, which is not linked into
# anything (rule R4): FBh over {25}, 95h over {08 0F 01}.
CMD 25 FB
TAR
RSP 0F 0F 08 0F 01 95
